    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "JICAGO\nUnited Air Lines\nPRINTED IN U.S.A.\n2011.126.452",
      "Beverages\nBOURBON\nWHISKIES\nSCOTCH\nTENNESSEE\nCANADIAN\nDAIQUIRI\nCOCKTAILS\nMAI TAI SCREWDRIVER\nUNITED'S VERY DRY GIN MARTINI\nSILVER VODKA MARTINI\nOLD FASHIONED\nMANHATTAN\nWHISKEY SOUR BLOODY MARY\nGIN\nVODKA\nRUM\nLIQUEURS\nBENEDICTINE AND BRANDY DRAMBUIE\nCOGNAC\nGALLIANO\n1.50\nWINES\nSPANISH SHERRY CHAMPAGNE\nSANGRIA\nRED WINE\nWHITE WINE\n1.00\nBEER .50\n* *\n*\nCOMPLIMENTARY SOFT BEVERAGES\nMinors Will Not Be Served Liquor.\nexpo 74\nWorld's Fair\nSpokane, USA May 4 - Nov 3, 1974\nMenu\nPRINCESS SALAD\nCREAMY ITALIAN DRESSING\nBRAISED SHORT RIBS OF BEEF, BERCY SAUCE\nChoice short ribs of beef are braised in a rich sauce with a touch\nof onions, mushrooms and California Red Wine.\nPOTATOES AU GRATIN\nFRESH GARDEN VEGETABLES\nor\nTHE CHEF'S FRIEND SHIP SPECIALTY\nMANICOTTI CASSEROLE\nA combination of Italian pasta, ricotta cheese with chives, topped\nwith a rich, well seasoned meat and tomato sauce.\nor\nFROM THE LAKES, STREAMS AND SEAS\nYes, fish do fly.\n. even those with shells on them.\ncatch is described on the enclosed menu card.\nThere's a little effort\nand a lot of love included\n.. please enjoy it.\nTry it at home\nthe recipe is on the back of the card.\nDINNER ROLL\nDESSERT\nCOFFEE SANKA TEA MILK\nThis menu prepared in United Air Lines Flight Kitchen\nat Los Angeles,\nRaoul Delbol. Executive Chef.\nMember,\nSociete Culinaire Philanthropique; Club Gastronomique\nProsper Montagne; Chevalier de l'Ordre de Saint Fortunat.\nPlease accept our apology if your choice is not available.\nLAXHH"
    ],
